# React components

- Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only for state, effects or browser APIs.
- Use named exports for shared components. Keep the default export for Next.js `page.tsx` and `layout.tsx`.
- Style with Tailwind classes. Merge conditional classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Build on the primitives in `components/ui` before writing new markup.

